Some of the more extreme sects of the [[Org/Althane/Creed of Ichor and Essence|Creed of Ichor and Essence]] take the belief one step further: not only are the [[Geography/Althane/Realms/index|realms]] not worthy of worship, but they're also actively wrathful and cruel and should be struggled against. They see the concept of prescribing blindly to the ideals of an external, unknowable force as equivalent to slavery; and, as such, work to break up large gatherings of followers of the pantheon, often to a violent end.
